      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Project Development**\n\nI'm beginning to build the Python files for the federated login flow, aiming for ten. Right now, I'm focused on `start_oauth_login.py`, with Google as the initial external provider. My plan is in motion.\n\n\n**Defining Data Models**\n\nI've shifted focus to `identity_models.py`, kicking off the Python file creation. It is a critical first step. I will establish the data models to support the entire identity flow using dataclasses, ensuring a clean and organized structure for subsequent files. This initial setup is proceeding well.\n\n\n",
